alias lever d0
alias LED d2

define electricUmbilical 1529453938

awaitingActivation:
s LED On 1
s LED Color 2
sb electricUmbilical Open 0
l r0 lever On
beq r0 1 OnUmbilical
yield
j awaitingActivation

OnUmbilical:
s LED On 1
s LED Color 4
sb electricUmbilical Open 1
l r0 lever On
beq r0 1 OnUmbilical
j awaitingActivation